{"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"isVolatile","symbolKind":"property","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"isVolatile"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNSource(py)isVolatile","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"getter","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"=","kind":"text"},{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setter","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"=","kind":"text"},{"text":"setVolatile:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","text":"BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isVolatile","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", tiles of this source are neither written to nor read from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ambient cache on disk, whatever the response’s "},{"code":"Cache-Control","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" header says;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"they are held in memory for as long as the map needs them. Use it for content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whose terms forbid storing it, or that must not outlive the session. Other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resources, such as a TileJSON file the source is configured with, are still"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cached. The default is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text